WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.185 --> 00:00:03.185
(high pitched sound from engines)

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:29.415
I saw that you applied to the flight academy again.

00:00:33.935 --> 00:00:35.575
I'm your new wingman, Sir.

00:00:44.435 --> 00:00:45.435
The coil.

00:00:47.315 --> 00:00:50.375
The local scum use it for cover to launch attacks.

00:00:51.195 --> 00:00:53.335
This is their turf, So move when I move.

00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:55.175
Keep your eyes open.

00:01:02.235 --> 00:01:04.695
No sudden moves.

00:01:04.695 --> 00:01:05.915
Who the hell are you?

00:01:08.765 --> 00:01:10.155
We're OMC.

00:01:11.855 --> 00:01:13.755
And OMC belongs to Satcom.

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:17.625
Is that your boss?

00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:19.725
Are we supposed to be scared of him or something?

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:22.815
Yeah.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.785
The OMC aren't the only ones listening into coms.

00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:45.275
All ships. We are under attack by vandal forces. Repeat.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.120
Vandal forces. Repeat. We're under attack.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:55.680
There have been battles.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.340
There have been losses.

00:02:07.705 --> 00:02:08.355
Each and

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:11.540
everyone of you has proven yourself time and time again.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.720
We will not lose this system!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.180
We will not fall back.

00:02:33.905 --> 00:02:35.215
We will win!

00:02:37.705 --> 00:02:39.415
Because we have to.

